### Test - Changer de lieu vers Mostaganem (durée Oran finalisée)
POST http://rofieda.lvh.me:8000/api/captures/update-position-realtime/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tag_rfid_num_serie": "RF02",
    "latitude": 36.7600,
    "longitude": 3.0650,
    "timestamp": "2025-08-21T13:36:00Z"
}

### Test SSE - Stream temps réel tous les trajets
GET http://rofieda.lvh.me:8000/api/captures/trajet-stream/ HTTP/1.1
Accept: text/event-stream
Cache-Control: no-cache
Connection: keep-alive

### Test SSE - Stream temps réel trajet spécifique (remplacer 1 par l'ID réel)
GET http://rofieda.lvh.me:8000/api/captures/trajet-stream/1/ HTTP/1.1
Accept: text/event-stream
Cache-Control: no-cache
Connection: keep-alive

### Test SSE - Stream alternatif tous les trajets
GET http://rofieda.lvh.me:8000/api/captures/trajet-stream-all/ HTTP/1.1
Accept: text/event-stream
Cache-Control: no-cache
Connection: keep-alive

### Vérifier le statut des objets
GET http://rofieda.lvh.me:8000/api/captures/check-objet-status/ HTTP/1.1

# Test SSE tous les trajets
curl -N -H "Accept: text/event-stream" -H "Cache-Control: no-cache" http://rofieda.lvh.me:8000/api/captures/trajet-stream/

# Test trajet spécifique
curl -N -H "Accept: text/event-stream" -H "Cache-Control: no-cache" http://rofieda.lvh.me:8000/api/captures/trajet-stream/1/